The following features have been added:

                1D experiments are now using the mc syntax as well.

                The commands "center", "ralign" and "lalign" have
                   been introduced.

                Various programs are now using ifdef statements for
                   the flag "LABEL_CN". This allows to use the same
                   program for either singly or doubly label compounds.

                The timing of nD programs has been changed (where required)
                   to control the chemical shift evolution in tn due to
                   the finite length of the first increment tn(0). This
                   is either done by adjusting the delays to in/2 or by
                   compensation using an echo.

                Triple resonance experiments have been modified in various
                   respects:
                   - N-15 evolution (for a maximum number of increments)
                   - frequency switching
                   - calculation of spoffs

                   - some experiments have been replaced with more recent
                     or more consistent versions.

Some less commonly used pulseprograms have been moved to an additional
   directory.
